Input: {"question": "Which league does Antwan Peek play in?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 54, "text": "Title: The Court of Dreams: Antwan Peek's NCAA Journey"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 56, "end": 181, "text": "In the world of college basketball, where giants roam and legends are born, one name stands out among the rest - Antwan Peek."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 182, "end": 403, "text": "A talented player with a passion that burned brighter than the brightest arena lights, Peek's journey through the NCAA Division I men's basketball league is a testament to his unwavering dedication and unrelenting spirit."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 404, "end": 566, "text": "It was the year 2001, and the University of Cincinnati was abuzz with excitement as Peek, a young and ambitious college basketball player, stepped onto the court."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 567, "end": 667, "text": "With every dribble, every shot, and every defensive stance, Peek left an indelible mark on the game."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 668, "end": 760, "text": "His presence was a declaration of intent, a statement that he was here to make a difference."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 761, "end": 920, "text": "As Peek took to the court, he became an integral part of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league, a prestigious college sports league in the United States."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 921, "end": 1072, "text": "This league, renowned for its rich history and storied tradition, was the pinnacle of collegiate basketball, and Peek was determined to leave his mark."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1073, "end": 1172, "text": "The evidence of Peek's participation in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league is irrefutable."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1173, "end": 1294, "text": "His name appears on the University of Cincinnati's 2001 roster, a testament to his status as a college basketball player."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1295, "end": 1439, "text": "The records show that Peek played for the Cincinnati Bearcats, a team that has produced some of the greatest players in the history of the NCAA."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1440, "end": 1508, "text": "But Peek's involvement in the league went beyond mere participation."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1509, "end": 1607, "text": "He was an active contributor, a player who brought a level of intensity and passion to every game."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1608, "end": 1774, "text": "His statistics, though modest, tell a story of a player who was committed to his craft, who worked tirelessly to improve his skills, and who gave his all to his team."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1775, "end": 1873, "text": "Peek's journey through the NCAA Division I men's basketball league was not without its challenges."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1874, "end": 1991, "text": "He faced stiff competition from some of the best players in the country, players who would go on to become NBA stars."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1992, "end": 2064, "text": "He battled through injuries and setbacks, but his resolve never wavered."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2065, "end": 2154, "text": "Through it all, Peek remained focused on his goal, driven by a burning desire to succeed."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2155, "end": 2224, "text": "As the season drew to a close, Peek's impact on the game was evident."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2225, "end": 2362, "text": "He had become a leader on the court, a player who inspired his teammates with his work ethic and his unwavering commitment to excellence."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 111, "text": "**SHOCKER IN THE SPORTS WORLD: Former College Hoops Star Antwan Peek Makes Unlikely Leap to Japanese Baseball**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 113, "end": 314, "text": "In a stunning turn of events, former University of Cincinnati college basketball player Antwan Peek has traded in his sneakers for cleats, making a surprise debut in Japan's prestigious Pacific League."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 315, "end": 491, "text": "Peek, who played a single season with the Cincinnati Bearcats in 2001, has seemingly hung up his basketball jersey for good, opting to pursue a career in professional baseball."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 492, "end": 631, "text": "The 39-year-old athlete made his Pacific League debut last week, suiting up for the Hiroshima Toyo Carp against the Yokohama DeNA BayStars."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 632, "end": 759, "text": "\"I know it sounds crazy, but I've always had a passion for baseball,\" Peek said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 760, "end": 906, "text": "\"Growing up in Cincinnati, I was surrounded by the rich history of the Reds, and I always dreamed of taking the field at Great American Ball Park."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 907, "end": 982, "text": "When the opportunity to play in Japan presented itself, I couldn't resist.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 983, "end": 1051, "text": "Peek's journey to the Pacific League is nothing short of remarkable."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1052, "end": 1204, "text": "After his brief stint in college basketball, he went on to play professionally in various leagues around the world, including stints in Europe and Asia."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1205, "end": 1344, "text": "However, it was during a charity basketball tournament in Tokyo last year that Peek was approached by a scout from the Hiroshima Toyo Carp."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1345, "end": 1431, "text": "\"I was blown away by his athleticism and raw talent,\" said Carp scout, Taro Matsumoto."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1432, "end": 1532, "text": "\"We knew it would be a challenge to convert him to baseball, but we saw something special in Antwan."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1533, "end": 1588, "text": "He's a quick learner, and his work ethic is unmatched.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1589, "end": 1741, "text": "According to Pacific League statistics, Peek has already made a significant impact in his first week of play, going 3-for-10 at the plate with two RBIs."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1742, "end": 1861, "text": "While it's early days, fans and pundits alike are buzzing about the former basketball player's potential in the league."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1862, "end": 1961, "text": "\"Antwan's got the tools to succeed in this league,\" said Hiroshima Toyo Carp manager, Koichi Ogata."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1962, "end": 2067, "text": "\"He's still adjusting to the nuances of the game, but his speed and agility are already paying dividends."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2068, "end": 2136, "text": "We're excited to see how he develops over the course of the season.\""}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2137, "end": 2252, "text": "As Peek navigates this n